        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"1d47f837-3b3d-4546-a0e9-8ab1858f14db\",\"review_text\":\"It's perfect has everything u want to listen to\"},{\"review_id\":\"7199b1ca-0175-4b3a-bc3a-5bc2002808e9\",\"review_text\":\"Previous issues are fixed. App is amazing.\"},{\"review_id\":\"cfee9554-8166-4507-9e88-4085003b8f3e\",\"review_text\":\"ㅗ love music\"},{\"review_id\":\"ba39c3fe-d6a4-4428-9b5b-80f4fada4b87\",\"review_text\":\"Trash\"},{\"review_id\":\"5b64c9e2-8127-4610-a46d-2cabc338909a\",\"review_text\":\"Super cool easy to use\"},{\"review_id\":\"f3069a3a-6009-4b11-b45a-098460aba4b8\",\"review_text\":\"Good music but the app is spotty. Sometimes I have to close it so it will play. It's hit or miss. Even when I have good signal. You do get some Spotify exclusive things. Love Rogan! Love him! Main reason I use this and not another music app.\"},{\"review_id\":\"058e78af-8fc3-4756-9f5d-bb067133407a\",\"review_text\":\"Very very worst app i have ever seen in my life only ads only ads no clearity ok songs\"},{\"review_id\":\"ef730aa8-289b-4622-ba74-a5eae0e8215f\",\"review_text\":\"there are no results when i search moaning female minor\"},{\"review_id\":\"e92c5097-1df4-427f-a658-8d1f798779eb\",\"review_text\":\"Yes you can learn to sign if The song has lyrics you can see. I also love Spotify I use the music of my choice and just dance for fun and exercise\"},{\"review_id\":\"ebf71a78-2c74-43f6-9330-149531d67eaa\",\"review_text\":\"Oohhh my God ! This is my most favourite app I love this app thanku developers for making this app.\"}]}"
